  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The escape speed from the surface of earth is v<sub>esc</sub>. The radius of earth is R. A satellite of mass m is in orbit at a height <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{R}{4}\"></span> above the surface of the Earth. What is the energy required to move the satellite to infinity?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{mv^{2}_{esc}}{5}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{2mv^{2}_{esc}}{5}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"mv^{2}_{esc}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2mv^{2}_{esc}\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
